  Title: Lower Agartha
  Parent: Locations
  RelativePath: \Root\Locations
  IsFolder: 1
  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: The lower stratum of the city of |Agartha|. Built and augmented from the
    existing infrastructure of |Agartha|. Contains a combination of residential districts
    interspersed with commercial and restaurant sectors. Due to the crowded conditions,
    personal transportation is rarely used, and most Agarthans rely on the dense network
    of trains centered on |Seven Stars Station|.
